# CTY-1's renders: the simulator's screens and lights (tools/site/mockups.py runs this). 'echo @name' then
# 'leds' names the lights that go with a shot. (Written by hand from a short generator; the clock's ticks repeat.)
splash 3200
reboot
wait 900
shot splash.png
wait 1500
shot splash_cty.png
wait 1200
# a city on the plains, already grown (set 1 N: the host grows a new city to stage N; set 46 B+1: its biome)
